## 📝 Notes

### Implementation Principles

1. **Python-First**: All new features in Python/Streamlit
2. **Local-First**: Data stays on device by default
3. **Privacy-Focused**: No data leaves without user consent
4. **Research-Backed**: Features based on proven patterns

### Decision Log

| Date | Decision | Rationale |
|------|----------|-----------|
| Feb 2026 | Implement Habit Score | Research shows rigid streaks cause churn |
| Feb 2026 | Add HP System | Loss aversion is 2x more powerful than gains |
| Feb 2026 | Prioritize Correlation Engine | High impact on user insights |

